{"height": 2, "weight": 30, "base_experience": 165, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "defense", "value": 1}], "genus": "Key Ring Pokémon", "capture_rate": 75, "base_happiness": 70, "hatch_counter": 20, "growth_rate": "fast", "egg_groups": ["mineral"], "gender_rate": 4, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "クレッフィ"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Cleffy"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "클레피"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "鑰圈兒"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Trousselin"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Clavion"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Klefki"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Klefki"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "クレッフィ"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "钥圈儿"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Klefki"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["x", "omega-ruby"], "text": "These key collectors threaten any attackers by fiercely jingling their keys at them."}, {"versions": ["y", "alpha-sapphire"], "text": "It never lets go of a key that it likes, so people give it the keys to vaults and safes as a way to prevent crime."}, {"versions": ["sun"], "text": "This even-tempered Pokémon has a habit of collecting keys. It will sneak into people’s homes to steal their keys."}, {"versions": ["moon"], "text": "It inserts its horn into chinks in metal, absorbing metal ions. For some reason, it collects keys."}, {"versions": ["ultra-sun"], "text": "Although it’s unclear why it collects keys, giving it a key makes Klefki very happy. However, it apparently only likes master keys."}, {"versions": ["ultra-moon"], "text": "Long ago it lived in mines, but once the minerals that make up its diet became scarcer, Klefki began appearing in human settlements."}, {"versions": ["sword"], "text": "This Pokémon is constantly collecting keys. Entrust a Klefki with important keys, and the Pokémon will protect them no matter what."}, {"versions": ["shield"], "text": "Klefki sucks in metal ions with the horn topping its head. It seems this Pokémon loves keys so much that its head needed to look like one, too."}], 